 a genuine K-linear map on M ⊗[ℤ] K (or explicit checked transport bridges ending in that carrier). A naive TensorProduct.map is only Z-linear and cannot be upgraded using an arbitrary Module K instance without proving the scalar compatibility. The current whole artifact is therefore not ready to submit as valid. This is formalization/API work, not a mathematical gap.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"Actual check_lean_types output showing the lTensor domain and codomain in reversed tensor order; Mathlib `LinearAlgebra/TensorProduct/Tower.lean` lines 183-190 and 232-248 define map and lTensor, while 264-280 define rTensor. Source P requires the original M ⊗[ℤ] K order.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Corrected and typechecked the H004 proposition encoding; confirmed the nine top-level artifact keys pass using a minimal checker control; replaced vacuous plan ports with a single substantive exact-target obligation. The target action still needs a faithful Lean definition, and the full artifact has not passed structural/type checks or independent semantic review. No mathematical gap is established.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registration or format work must use TASK_INCOMPLETE: this records progress without ending the stage; continue the actual work. Difficulty or artifact incompletion alone is not a mathematical gap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of check_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of submit_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_lean_types","description":"Compile a partial mathematical definition header and selected Lean type or ordinary API term expressions with explicit parameters. Never accepts a final interface or adds a proved premise.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"header":{"type":"string"},"parameters":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"types":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["header","parameters","types"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false}],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":false,"prompt_cache_key":"155d18c8-7a7c-4005-8cf4-54269cb8062c","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"low"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"effort":"high","context":"all_turns","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":88704,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":70912,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":427,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":70},"total_tokens":89131,"attribution":{"items":{"fc_05ead64b871aca2a016adb5ee8d6f48191a3828e0169a9e500":{"input_tokens":31,"cached_tokens":31,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_05ead64b871aca2a016adb5